Do not use as a production release. Run real proxy/TUN tests only in the
isolated Windows 11 VM. The portable entrypoint is FlClashX.exe; do not launch
FlClashAgent.exe or FlClashHelperService.exe directly. Export
connections_diagnostic.log from the Connections page after reproducing an
issue, then run Collect-FlClashXLogs.ps1 to collect the bounded evidence set.
Do not share Agent/Helper token files. Strict WFP capture is not enabled by
this unsigned package and requires separately signed driver/Broker artifacts.
